      {
        "id": 987651,
        "type": "",
        "body": "<!-- release-linkback -->\n<details>\n<summary><a href=\"https://gitlab.example.com/acme/toolkit/-/releases/v2.1.0\">Release v2.1.0 — 14 commits, 3 fixes</a></summary>\n<p>\n\n## Highlights\n\n* `parser`: accept trailing commas in list literals\n* `cli`: `--quiet` now silences progress bars as well\n* `config`: warn instead of failing on an unknown key\n\n## Fixes\n\n| Ref | Area | Summary |\n| -- | -- | -- |\n| !318 | parser | off-by-one on empty input |\n| !321 | cli | exit code lost when piped |\n| !324 | config | default path ignored on Windows |\n\nGenerated diff of the version bump:\n\n```diff\n-version = \"2.0.3\"\n+version = \"2.1.0\"\n```\n\nFull changelog is attached to the release.\n\n</p>\n</details>",
